<details id="image-compare" class="image-compare" hidden>
  <summary>Compare with the parent original</summary>
  <p class="image-help">Review the edit and its recorded parent. The checklist holds your manual observations; no automatic content check is performed.</p>
  <button id="image-compare-load" type="button" class="quiet-button" disabled>Load both originals</button>
  <p id="image-compare-status" class="image-help" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose an archived edit that has a recorded parent.</p>
  <p id="image-compare-error" class="compare-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
  <div id="image-compare-workspace" hidden>
    <div class="compare-controls">
      <label for="image-compare-mode">Layout<select id="image-compare-mode"><option value="side">Side by side</option><option value="slider">Sliding divider</option></select></label>
      <label for="image-compare-zoom">Display size<select id="image-compare-zoom"><option value="fit">Fit to screen</option><option value="native">100% · original pixels</option></select></label>
      <label class="compare-checkbox" for="image-compare-sync"><input id="image-compare-sync" type="checkbox" checked>Synchronized scrolling</label>
    </div>
    <p id="image-compare-dimensions" class="image-help"></p>
    <div id="image-compare-side" class="compare-side">
      <figure><figcaption>Parent original</figcaption><div id="image-compare-parent-scroll" class="compare-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Parent original: scrollable preview"><img id="image-compare-parent-image" alt="Recorded parent original of this edit"></div></figure>
      <figure><figcaption>Edit result</figcaption><div id="image-compare-result-scroll" class="compare-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Result: scrollable preview"><img id="image-compare-result-image" alt="Archived result of the edit"></div></figure>
    </div>
    <div id="image-compare-slider" hidden>
      <div id="image-compare-slider-scroll" class="compare-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable sliding comparison"><div id="image-compare-stage" class="compare-stage"><img id="image-compare-slider-parent" alt="Parent original under the divider"><img id="image-compare-slider-result" class="compare-overlay" alt="Result on the divider"><span id="image-compare-seam" class="compare-seam" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div>
      <label for="image-compare-position">Reveal the result <span id="image-compare-percent">50%</span><input id="image-compare-position" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="50"></label>
      <p class="image-help">The result appears left of the divider; the parent appears on the right.</p>
    </div>
    <details class="compare-provenance"><summary>Identity of the two verified archives</summary><dl id="image-compare-provenance"></dl></details>
    <div class="compare-review-heading"><h3>My review checklist</h3><button id="image-compare-add" type="button" class="quiet-button">Add an item</button></div>
    <p class="image-help">The constraints recorded in the brief are copied word for word and stay “To check” until you review them. The observations stay in this page; export the JSON to keep and reopen them.</p>
    <div id="image-compare-items" class="compare-items"></div>
    <p id="image-compare-review-status" class="image-help" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div class="compare-file-actions"><button id="image-compare-export" type="button" class="quiet-button">Save the JSON review</button><label class="quiet-button compare-import" for="image-compare-file">Reopen a JSON review<input id="image-compare-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label></div>
  </div>
</details>
